  "text": "The perfect omeletion can be created by following these simple steps:\n\n1. Heat a nonstick pan over medium heat, ensuring it is completely dry.\n2. Crack 2 large eggs into the pan and gently swirl them until the edges begin to set.\n3. Push the edges toward the center, forming a small well, and cook for a few seconds.\n4. Sprinkle cheese on top of the well and cook until the cheese melts and the edges are golden brown.\n5. Place a lid on the pan and let the omeletion cook for about 30 seconds.\n6. Carefully flip the omeletion to cook the other side.\n7. Serve immediately and enjoy!\n\nThis simple procedure will ensure a perfect, delicious omeletion.",
